{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:25 2026-08-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:25 2026-08-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:25 2026-08-12 HKT</p><p>筲箕灣有人墮海。今日（12日）早上8時19分，一名男子在太康街38號對開的筲箕灣避風塘墮海，途人發現他在海中載浮載沉，於是報警。救援人員趕到現場將男子救起，惟事主陷入昏迷，由救護車急送往東區醫院救治。</p><p>現場消息稱，墮海男子年約七旬，警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"現場是筲箕灣避風塘。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0009d975c215500407b25ad6d4bd1def/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_13_44.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"男子在太康街38號對開的筲箕灣避風塘墮海。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/1228b66396e9983e9ed83a5e7784292d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_13_43.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"事主昏迷獲送院搶救。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac69d7efbc80bf369ee18a9c09c8c2ec/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_14_15.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ae166de7c0cde76a96706d63efb1d49a/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_13_44_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/4ad5198b53400293a2481adbd76cda79/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_13_45.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T01:40:23.180553+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}